          "text": "{\"blocks\":[{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"I’d choose the Aeroplan award below as the best balance among these shown award choices: it has the earliest arrival of the three and the most reported seats. The tradeoff is that it arrives later than the other award option that leaves at noon, and it still requires a connection. These are selected search results, not a complete inventory.\"},{\"k\":\"p\",\"r\":\"J1@2027-01-15T23:15-08:00/SFO>BKK/E>2027-01-17T10:35\",\"n\":\"Best balance: earlier arrival and two reported seats\",\"v\":\"Departs SFO January 15 at 11:15 p.m. and arrives in Bangkok January 17 at 10:35 a.m.; the award shows 65,000 Aeroplan points in economy, one stop at HKG, and two seats. The HKG connection is 1 hour 45 minutes. Taxes are quoted as CAD 107.40, with price scope unknown. The cabin is reported as economy for the award, but the cabin of each leg is not specified.\"},{\"k\":\"x\",\"r\":\"T02\"},{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"Compared with the later-arriving award below, this arrives 6 hours 15 minutes earlier. It is not the earliest departure or arrival among the shown awards.\"},{\"k\":\"a\",\"r\":\"J7@2027-01-15T12:00-08:00/SFO>BKK/E>2027-01-17T01:25\",\"n\":\"Earlier departure and earliest arrival\",\"v\":\"Departs SFO January 15 at noon and arrives January 17 at 1:25 a.m. The award shows 65,000 Aeroplan points in economy, one stop at TPE, one reported seat, and a 4-hour 30-minute connection. Taxes are quoted as CAD 116.50, with price scope unknown. Its advantage is reaching Bangkok earlier; its downside is leaving 11 hours 15 minutes earlier than the recommended option and having one reported seat rather than two. The cabin of each leg is not specified.\"},{\"k\":\"x\",\"r\":\"T06\"},{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"The recommended option’s elapsed journey is 2 hours 5 minutes shorter than this one; that is a journey-duration difference, not an arrival-time difference.\"},{\"k\":\"a\",\"r\":\"J13@2027-01-15T23:30-08:00/SFO>BKK/E>2027-01-17T16:50\",\"n\":\